	(text "OOMWOO Hall sensor board (rev 1, 2026-10-28). One design, fitted twice: dust bin present (magnet in the bin) and the\nLiDAR tower bumper (magnet in the tower cover). Omnipolar: either magnet pole works. OUT goes low with the magnet near;\nthe main board pulls OUT up (47k), so open-drain and push-pull outputs both work. It samples at ~20-45 Hz.\nRefs 87xx: unique on the OOMWOO panel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0fccef13-4077-4b3f-8dbb-bdec7a43bdc9")
	)
